{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265Tgw97QPTx1793787840.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有統計指，上月本港強積金(MPF)人均蝕逾8,600元。</p><p></p><p>強積金顧問GUM統計顯示，十月強積金投資回報為負百分之2.6，相當於每個「打工仔」的強積金戶口平均蝕8,677元，已經是連續兩個月錄得虧損。但今年來仍賺11,610元。</p><p></p><p>三大主要基金類別，上月只有固定收益基金有得賺，混合資產基金蝕百分之2，股票基金虧損百分之4。</p><p></p><p>由於科技股急挫，亞洲市場首當其衝，大中華股票基金上月虧損百分之9，香港及亞洲股票也跌百分之7至8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:39.427811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:21.741803+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:35.030043+00:00","content_hash":"986be6f3f3abffff53d9c70ab75ea7aae9c6a6b172729c8ab42834920e73446a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:39.427811+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}